{"resourceIdentifier":"3025","resourceName":"CSD Wastewater Treatment Plant Project in Hebei Province","description":"CSD Wastewater Treatment Plant Project in Hebei Province is located in Hebei Province, China. The project includes five sewage treatment plants. The whole aerobic process includes pre-treatment process, secondary biological treatment process, tertiary deep treatment process and sludge treatment process, with a maximum design influent flow of 210,000 m3/d (The total amount of five sewage treatment plants), the influent and effluent COD concentration are 850 mg/L and 50 mg/L, separately. The wastewater is composed of industrial wastewater and some domestic wastewater within the service area. The project can reduce environmental pollution and destroy methane emissions from the open anaerobic lagoons in baseline scenario, the best available low-cost solution for wastewater treatment.\r\nEmission reductions of this project are generated by reducing methane emissions of the open anaerobic lagoons in baseline scenario. The project started construction on February 2020 and put into operation in December 2020. The project put into test run from 18/12/2020 to 04/01/2021. The earliest official operational date of the five treatment plants is January 1, 2021, and the project began official operation on January 1, 2021.","location":{"latitude":37.619222,"longitude":114.870804},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-16","endExclusive":"2022-06-16","endInclusive":"2022-06-15"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3025"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hebei Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CSD Water Service Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Beijing, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3025"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"117143"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0080"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"10/03/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/01/2021 - 31/12/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=66678&IDKEY=kiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf991948962","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-PD CSD Wastewater Treatment Plant Project in Hebei Province-V02-clean (2).pdf","uploadDate":"2022-05-16T18:36:39.93Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=63570&IDKEY=aq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhk87663030","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing Representation-CSD Hebei.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-18T11:59:01.883Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=86245&IDKEY=m903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdf4118931855","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Joint-Project-Description-Monitoring-Report-CSD Wastewater Treatment Plant Project in Hebei Province V03-Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-03-10T16:11:53.96Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=79861&IDKEY=aq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhn110128319","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"VCS